        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 97.983,
          "en": "as a starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 101.75999999999999,
          "en": "But besides this React project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 105.03,
          "en": "you'll also notice that there is a backend folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.03,
          "end": 107.03999999999999,
          "en": "in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.03999999999999,
          "end": 108.75,
          "en": "And this backend folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.75,
          "end": 112.22999999999999,
          "en": "contains a separate non-React project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.22999999999999,
          "end": 116.13,
          "en": "that will provide us a dummy backend to talk to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.13,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "So a backend those requests can be sent to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "This is written with Node and ExpressJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "and it's all in one file basically, in this app.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 130.83,
          "en": "which you find in this backend folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.83,
          "end": 132.87,
          "en": "And if you know Node and Express,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.87,
          "end": 135.09,
          "en": "you can definitely take a look at that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "But you don't need to know NodeJS and ExpressJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 142.98,
          "en": "because that's why I am providing this starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.98,
          "end": 143.813,
          "en": "to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.813,
          "end": 146.523,
          "en": "so that you don't have to write all this code on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.9,
          "en": "But we will of course, work on this React code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.9,
          "end": 154.95,
          "en": "in this section and add this Tanstack Query library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.95,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "to this project so that we can use it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 161.57999999999998,
          "en": "and so that we can dive into all its core features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "Now, if you are following along locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 166.68,
          "en": "you should therefore open your terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.68,
          "end": 168.84,
          "en": "and as always, run npm install once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 170.823,
          "en": "to install all those dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.99,
          "end": 173.97,
          "en": "But you then also need to do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.97,
          "end": 177.48,
          "en": "inside of that backend folder, because that backend project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 180.303,
          "en": "also comes with some dependencies that are needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.29,
          "end": 184.8,
          "en": "And you then need to start two development servers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "one for the backend and one for the frontend project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 190.5,
          "en": "So still in that backend folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.5,
          "end": 193.08,
          "en": "you should then run npm start in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 195.55,
          "en": "to start that backend development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.47,
          "end": 199.11,
          "en": "and keep that process up and running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.11,
          "end": 201.78,
          "en": "as long as you are working in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.78,
          "end": 204.45,
          "en": "And in a new terminal window,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 204.45,
          "end": 206.04,
          "en": "which then should be navigated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.04,
          "end": 208.35,
          "en": "back into the main project folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "so the overall folder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 213.45,
          "en": "you should start your frontend project development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.45,
          "end": 215.52,
          "en": "with npm run dev.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.52,
          "end": 219.15,
          "en": "And that then, as always, allows you to visit that project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.15,
          "end": 221.85,
          "en": "via that address that's showing up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.85,
          "end": 224.97,
          "en": "so that you should see something like this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.97,
          "end": 227.43,
          "en": "On CodeSandbox, as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.43,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "you don't need to install anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 231.66,
          "en": "and you don't need to run any commands.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 231.66,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "Instead there it should all already be up and running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 237.063,
          "en": "and it should all work already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.05,
          "end": 240.39,
          "en": "And with that, we're now all set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 243.48,
          "en": "and we're ready to dive into Tanstack Query,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.48,
